From 8ce92ec990de6cc69cd6788855cda76b3bb58b29 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: terminills <tdeters@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 05:52:17 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 401/638] [AROS] Trace child compositor commit activation

Runtime43 proves the child surface ID reaches LayerTreeHost pending state but never reaches AsyncLayerTreeFrameSink. Replace root-exhausted process-global probes with per-instance counters and record WillCommit, impl BeginCommit, FinishCommit state transfer, ActivateSyncTree, and child allocator update.

Also bound the previously unbounded SetLocalSurfaceId sink diagnostic to 16 entries per sink so the root compositor cannot flood the runtime log.

AI_PHASE: chromium-process-model

AI_STATUS: diagnostic

AI_OBSERVED: Child LayerTreeHost accepts LocalSurfaceId(2,1), while its connected sink receives 16 begins and zero surface assignments.

AI_FIX_REASON: Distinguish main-thread commit scheduling, cross-thread CommitState transfer, pending-tree activation, and allocator update in one replay.

AI_SCOPE: LayerTreeHost/Impl and AsyncLayerTreeFrameSink cc/h only.

AI_VALIDATION: git diff --check; build and hosted runtime pending by design.

AI_DECISION_CHAIN: runtime43 Blink delivery pass -> child WillCommit -> impl FinishCommit -> activation -> sink surface assignment.
---
 .../async_layer_tree_frame_sink.cc            |  9 ++-
 .../async_layer_tree_frame_sink.h             |  1 +
 cc/trees/layer_tree_host.cc                   | 19 +++++-
 cc/trees/layer_tree_host.h                    |  6 ++
 cc/trees/layer_tree_host_impl.cc              | 66 +++++++++++++++++--
 cc/trees/layer_tree_host_impl.h               |  5 ++
 6 files changed, 96 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

diff --git a/cc/mojo_embedder/async_layer_tree_frame_sink.cc b/cc/mojo_embedder/async_layer_tree_frame_sink.cc
